iep:SemioticFacetShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:deactivated true ; rdfs:comment "DECLARED, NOT YET SPECIFIED. This shape carries no constraints, so it validated nothing while reading — from its name, its rdfs:isDefinedBy and its dereferenceable IRI — as though it enforced the invariant it is named for. sh:deactivated says so in data: a SHACL processor now correctly produces no results for it, rather than producing none by accident. Remove this flag in the same change that gives it constraints." ; ; rdfs:label "SemioticFacet SHACL shape" ; sh:targetClass iep:SemioticFacet ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://markjspivey-xwisee.github.io/interego/ns/iep#>.
iep:TrustFacetShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:deactivated true ; rdfs:comment "DECLARED, NOT YET SPECIFIED. This shape carries no constraints, so it validated nothing while reading — from its name, its rdfs:isDefinedBy and its dereferenceable IRI — as though it enforced the invariant it is named for. sh:deactivated says so in data: a SHACL processor now correctly produces no results for it, rather than producing none by accident. Remove this flag in the same change that gives it constraints." ; ; rdfs:label "TrustFacet SHACL shape" ; sh:targetClass iep:TrustFacet ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://markjspivey-xwisee.github.io/interego/ns/iep#>.
